        <mxCell id="eKR32WB9SgWe6bQIORxq-93" value="In this case it needs to follow a phrasing template&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ability to [business specific sec objective]&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;examples:&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Ability to prevent Corda network member spoofing/impersonation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Ability to preserve Corda ledger transaction information disclosure to other network participant not part of a transaction&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Ability to maintain fundamental confidentiality integrity and availability of the network Participant CordApp ledger //THIS IS HIGH LEVEL for R.C.E.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Compliance with regulations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;opacity=50;verticalAlign=top;" parent="eKR32WB9SgWe6bQIORxq-25" vertex="1">
