        <mxCell id="Q0BMg-39yYRw_ecn6O9p-18" value="&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: initial; border-color: var(--border-color); font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;Find domain specific generic threats&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Identify domain specific generic threats using simple rules (&lt;/span&gt;hypothesis)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The threat exist even if mitigated(!) not just finding the implementation gap&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Inductive reasoning (top down)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;limit the number cases to start with (efficient)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
